WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.070
On a railway building site, an explosion
fires an iron rod up through the front

2
00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:06.750
of a worker's skull.

3
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.810
Somehow, he survives.

4
00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:09.740
He walks.

5
00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:10.750
He talks.

6
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.340
He goes back home.

7
00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:16.870
But back home, the people around him
slowly notice that something about him is

8
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:17.980
different.

9
00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:22.020
So what could an iron rod through
the front of the head have changed?

10
00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:25.450
In this mission, you'll find
out what neurological damage is,

11
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.540
from a stroke or an injury.

12
00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:30.240
Its effects depend on where the damage is:

13
00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:33.540
one ability can be lost
while others are untouched.

14
00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:36.630
Then you'll find out what the
very front of the brain does,

15
00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.470
right where the rod passed.

16
00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:41.720
Your mission: work out
what the rod took from him.
